## Creator.Wardrobe — left vs right panels

In **`editMode: wardrobe`** only:

| Area | DOM (ids / classes) | Role |
|------|---------------------|------|
| **Left** | `#creator-wardrobe-parts-panel` | **Wardrobe layer tree** — pick which **wardrobe layer** is active (hierarchy, labels). |
| **Right** | `#creator-upper-right-panels-root` | **Outfits** (`#creator-wardrobe-outfits-panel`, `#creator-skin-selector`) plus **wardrobe library panels** — `.creator-wardrobe-library-panel` grids (thumbnails / part choices) for the **selected wardrobe layer**. Which libraries are visible updates when the selection changes. |

Say **wardrobe library panels** (or **right-hand wardrobe panels**) for the dynamic `.creator-wardrobe-library-panel` content on the right. Say **wardrobe parts panel** for the **left** tree. Do not call the left tree “layers panel” — **`#creator-layers-panel`** is the skin/paint layer panel in 2D/3D only (`src/creator/modePanels.ts`, `src/creator/skinLayersPanel.ts`).
